 core: `Uranus forms a square to Pluto, 90 degrees of friction between disruption and transformation. The planet that breaks pattern and the planet that demands death-and-rebirth are cutting across each other. Uranus says innovate, disrupt, change through revolution. Pluto says transform, destroy, change through depth. The square holds both as legitimate forces that create friction because they're both operating at full strength.`,
