 friendship: `Friends experience you as someone whose innovation and intensity are in tension. Sometimes you change through disruption; sometimes through transformation.`,
 romantic: `Partners notice Uranus's revolutionary innovation and Pluto's transformative depth cut across each other. Both serve power but create friction.`,
 feed: `Uranus and Pluto are at friction point between these charts today. One person's disruptive clarity and the other person's transformative power are cutting across each other. When Uranus wants innovation, Pluto demands total transformation. The friction is structural.`,
 sonic: `Uranus and Pluto in the square operate in incompatible harmonic territories. Uranus's sudden breaks and Pluto's transformative intensity create friction. The result is music where disruption and death-and-rebirth cut across each other.`,
 core_synastry: `Uranus square Pluto between these charts means one person's disruptive principle and the other person's transformative principle are at ninety-degree tension. Revolution and death-and-rebirth cut across each other.`,
 behavioral_synastry: `When one person's Uranus wants revolutionary disruption, the other person's Pluto wants total transformation, and both are legitimate but geometrically incompatible. These relationships work when both develop fluency in when to honor Uranus's innovation and when to honor Pluto's depth.`,
 friendship_synastry: `One friend's Uranus meets the other friend's Pluto at square. Disruption and transformation are at friction point.`,
 romantic_synastry: `One partner's Uranus stands square to the other's Pluto. Revolutionary innovation and transformative intensity cut across each other. The work is building a relationship that can hold both.`,
 core_transit: `Transiting Uranus forms a square to your natal Pluto, friction between disruption and transformation. What breaks pattern and what demands death-and-rebirth are cutting across each other during this multi-year period. The square is asking you to find change that includes both appropriate innovation and appropriate transformation.`,
 behavioral_transit: `You'll feel the pull between Uranus's "change through disruption" and your Pluto's "change through transformation" more sharply during this extended window. Use this friction to examine which situations need revolutionary innovation and which need total death-and-rebirth.`
